This license covers the ORIGINAL code of this project:

  * x816.sv                              (top level)
  * rtl/bank0_ram.sv, rtl/boot_rom.sv, rtl/flat_sdram.sv
  * rtl/cpu/65C816/p65c816_flat_wrap.vhd (the 24-bit CPU wrapper)
  * boot/                                (boot ROM stub and its build script)
  * files.qip, X816.qsf, X816.qpf, x816.sdc, doc/

